WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.070
I dug a trench and found bright white chunks.

2
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:12.620
A few days later they had vanished into the thin air — it was ice!

3
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:17.580
My laser even saw snow falling from the clouds above me.

4
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:25.970
Winter came, the Sun disappeared, and my solar panels broke under the weight of frozen carbon dioxide.

5
00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:31.080
I tasted the ice. Then the winter buried me.
